0 2h.01a1 1 0 100-2H7zm3 0a1 1 0 100 2h3a1 1 0 100-2h-3z" clip-rule="evenodd"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#10; &lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;h3 class="text-xl font-bold"&gt;About open62541&lt;/h3&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed"&gt;&#10; open62541 is an open source implementation of OPC UA (OPC Unified Architecture / IEC 62541) written in the C language. The library is usable with all major compilers and provides the necessary tools to implement dedicated OPC UA clients and servers, or to integrate OPC UA-based communication into existing applications.&#10; &lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Join Our Community</title><link>https://open62541.org/community/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://open62541.org/community/</guid><description>&lt;div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="text-center mb-12"&gt;&#10; &lt;p class="text-xl text-gray-600"&gt;Connect with developers, ask questions, and contribute to open62541&lt;/p&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-12"&gt;&#10; &lt;!-- GitHub Card --&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow duration-300 overflow-hidden"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-800 to-gray-900 p-8 text-center"&gt;&#10; &lt;img src="https://open62541.org/images/github.svg" alt="GitHub" class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto mb-4 filter invert"&gt;&#10; &lt;h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white"&gt;GitHub Issues&lt;/h2&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="p-6"&gt;&#10; &lt;p class="text-gray-600 mb-4"&gt;Report bugs, request features, or contribute to the project. If there are any problems, feel free to open an issue.&lt;/p&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-3 mb-6 text-center"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="text-sm text-primary-600 font-mono"&gt;github.com/open62541/open62541&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://github.com/open62541/open62541/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-full px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold transition duration-200 bg-gray-900 text-white hover:bg-gray-800"&gt;&#10; Open GitHub Issues&#10; &lt;svg class="w-5 h-5 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&#10; &lt;path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#10; &lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;!-- Mailing List Card --&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow duration-300 overflow-hidden"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-500 to-primary-600 p-8 text-center"&gt;&#10; &lt;img src="https://open62541.org/images/google.svg" alt="Google Groups" class="w-20 h-20 mx-auto mb-4"&gt;&#10; &lt;h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white"&gt;Mailing List&lt;/h2&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="p-6"&gt;&#10; &lt;p class="text-gray-600 mb-4"&gt;Join our Google Groups mailing list for announcements, discussions, and community support.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>License</title><link>https://open62541.org/license/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://open62541.org/license/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="mit-license"&gt;MIT License&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Copyright (c) 2024&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy&#10;of this software and associated documentation files (the &amp;ldquo;Software&amp;rdquo;), to deal&#10;in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights&#10;to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell&#10;copies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is&#10;furnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>OPC UA Certification</title><link>https://open62541.org/certification/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://open62541.org/certification/</guid><description>&lt;div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto"&gt;&#10; &lt;!-- Hero Section with Logo --&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-gray-50 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border-2 border-primary-100 p-8 mb-12"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center"&gt;&#10; &lt;div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="inline-block bg-primary-100 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 mb-4"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="text-primary-700 font-semibold text-sm"&gt;OPC Foundation Certified&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4"&gt;Certified Implementation&lt;/h2&gt;&#10; &lt;p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4"&gt;The sample server built using open62541 has been certified by the OPC Foundation for compliance with the &lt;span class="font-semibold text-primary-700"&gt;Standard Server 2017&lt;/span&gt; profile.&lt;/p&gt;&#10; &lt;p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed"&gt;This certification demonstrates that open62541 provides a robust, standards-compliant OPC UA implementation suitable for production use.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Privacy Policy</title><link>https://open62541.org/privacy/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://open62541.org/privacy/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="1-controller"&gt;1. Controller&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;We are data controllers as we process the personal data of our customers and partners. You will find our contact information in the imprint.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;If you have questions about processing your data, you can contact us via &lt;a href="mailto:contact@o6-automation.com"&gt;contact@o6-automation.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="2-processing-activities"&gt;2. Processing Activities&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="website-visitors"&gt;Website visitors&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;When you visit our website, we collect anonymised statistical data about your visit in order to understand how our website is used and to improve it over time. Details are described in the &amp;ldquo;Website analytics&amp;rdquo; subsection below.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Professional Support</title><link>https://open62541.org/support/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://open62541.org/support/</guid><description>&lt;div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"&gt;&#10; &lt;!-- Hero --&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="text-center mb-12"&gt;&#10; &lt;h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4"&gt;Professional Support for open62541&lt;/h1&gt;&#10; &lt;p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed"&gt;&#10; The open62541 library is free and open source under the MPL v2.0. For production deployments, however, professional backing is usually essential.&#10; &lt;/p&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;!-- Free vs Professional Callout --&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"&gt;&#10; &lt;svg class="w-7 h-7 text-gray-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"&gt;&#10; &lt;path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M3 4a1 1 0 011-1h12a1 1 0 110 2H4a1 1 0 01-1-1zm0 4a1 1 0 011-1h12a1 1 0 110 2H4a1 1 0 01-1-1zm0 4a1 1 0 011-1h12a1 1 0 110 2H4a1 1 0 01-1-1zm0 4a1 1 0 011-1h12a1 1 0 110 2H4a1 1 0 01-1-1z" clip-rule="evenodd"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&#10; &lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800"&gt;Open Source &amp;amp; Free&lt;/h2&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4"&gt;&#10; open62541 is licensed under the &lt;strong&gt;Mozilla Public License v2.0&lt;/strong&gt;. The library is free of charge &amp;mdash; even for commercial use. You can download, integrate, and ship it without any license fees.&#10; &lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Query Parser</title><link>https://open62541.org/query-parser/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://open62541.org/query-parser/</guid><description>&lt;div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"&gt;&#10; &lt;!-- Hero --&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="text-center mb-12"&gt;&#10; &lt;h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4"&gt;OPC UA EventFilter Query Language&lt;/h1&gt;&#10; &lt;p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed"&gt;&#10; Convert a formal query language into the OPC UA Event Filter byte-code encoding &amp;mdash; directly in your browser.&#10; &lt;/p&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;!-- Background --&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-6 mb-8"&gt;&#10; &lt;p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3"&gt;&#10; OPC UA Event Filters provide powerful constructs for the server-side selection of relevant events, but the feature&#10; is underused in practice because of their complexity. Event Filters are expressed in a &amp;ldquo;byte-code&amp;rdquo;&#10; encoding, and assembling that encoding by hand is difficult and error-prone.&#10; &lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Training &amp; Workshops</title><link>https://open62541.org/training/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://open62541.org/training/</guid><description>&lt;div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"&gt;&#10; &lt;!-- Hero --&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="text-center mb-12"&gt;&#10; &lt;h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4"&gt;OPC UA &amp;amp; open62541 Training&lt;/h1&gt;&#10; &lt;p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed"&gt;&#10; Hands-on training and workshops from fundamentals to advanced mechanisms &amp;mdash; delivered by the developers who build the open62541 SDK.&#10; &lt;/p&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;!-- Upcoming Public Training --&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl mb-12"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-600 to-primary-800"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_right,rgba(255,255,255,0.12),transparent_60%)]"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="relative px-8 py-10 sm:px-12 text-white"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm px-4 py-1.5 mb-5"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="text-sm font-medium tracking-wide"&gt;Next public training&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/div&gt;&#10; &lt;h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mb-3 text-white"&gt;3-Days OPC UA / open62541 Developer Training&lt;/h2&gt;&#10; &lt;p class="text-white/85 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-2xl"&gt;&#10; Three days of practical OPC UA and open62541 training with the core developers &amp;mdash; from the fundamentals through secure communication and PubSub.&#10; &lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>